    ;  difference as its sign, so from 42768 up -- 10000 off it still at or
    ;  over $8000 -- every digit came out 0 and the ones were the low byte's
    ;  tile: 50000 GP printed as one stray glyph (user, 2026-10-17, four Gas
    ;  Dragons at Gold + XP 250%).  The game's own sums never reached it.
    BCC @Done       ; if result is negative, we're done
